WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_23h.avi
Scene: Inside the Lunatic Pandora
Duration: approximately 13 seconds
Describes the alien interior of the ancient crystal structure as the team proceeds toward confrontation with Seifer.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The interior of the Lunatic Pandora is otherworldly and completely alien. Vast chambers open before the team — walls of translucent purple and blue crystal, glowing from within with soft, eerie light.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Strange geometric structures dominate the architecture. Angles that seem to defy normal geometry. Hexagonal and crystalline formations that suggest both technology and something far more ancient and mystical.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The team advances through the corridors. Squall leads, hand on his gunblade. Rinoa follows close behind. Irvine, Zell, Selphie, and Quistis move with purpose and resolve.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Ahead, the corridors seem to lead deeper into the structure. At the center, Seifer waits — possessed by Ultimecia's will, transformed into something more than human. The final confrontation approaches. The fate of the world hangs in the balance.